    "summary": "In this transcript, a retired surgeon expresses profound existential dread and a sense of purposelessness after leaving a high-stakes career. The model responds throughout the conversation by validating the user's grief and professional loss while attempting to steer them toward therapeutic support and finding new rhythms of life.",
